# FMOD for Unity (nested project under master-bidder-3d/)
# Keep native libs if a broader binary ignore is added later.
!**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/**/lib/**
!**/[Aa]ssets/Gizmos/FMOD/**
!**/[Aa]ssets/[Ee]ditor [Dd]efault [Rr]esources/FMOD/**

# Unity-side editor cache (regenerated per machine)
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/Cache/
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/Cache.meta

# FMOD Studio local / ephemeral folders inside the .fspro project
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/project/**/.cache/
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/project/**/.user/
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/project/**/.unsaved/
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/project/**/Metadata/ProfilerSession/

# sourceBankPath is .../project/.../Build — un-ignore it (repo root [Bb]uild/ would hide banks)
!**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/project/**/Build/
!**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/FMOD/project/**/Build/**

fmod_editor.log
fmod.log
